Added a dedicated examples guide with concrete generate→qc→viz commands, override snippets, and troubleshooting, and linked it in the docs index for discoverability. In `docs/20_EXAMPLES.md` I used a CSV-first quickstart to avoid pyarrow dependency, mapped expected artifact locations, and included label ratio/QC/viz override examples aligned with the config conventions; `docs/README.md` now lists the new guide in the recommended reading order.

